{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53492","headline":"登石伞峰 · 卫中行","name":"登石伞峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"威凤昔未起，兹山嘉气深。\n逶迤抱川阜，萝茑方沈沈。\n龙节稍岩径，星轩伴幽寻。\n尝闻谢公事，今嘉昭旷心。\n绝顶上巍峨，秋晨好登临。\n芦洲辨微色，天籁闻虚吟。\n支策睇归湖，舒情凝远岑。\n徘徊绕灵伞，登坐延芳襟。\n溪路鏁重扃，松门交翠阴。\n贞姿在空谷，瑞色仍栖林。\n晚霭覆回汀，轻桡环碧浔。\n探奇幸陪唱，愿继咸池音。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卫中行","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}